From b3e0180227c361eddb54fd6b04eb9f82a981e617 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic-session.local>
Date: Sun, 2 Aug 2026 06:32:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(healthcare): restore genuine HC Denial War Room content

hc-denial-war-room.html was wholesale-replaced by commit 1f891e86
('literal fix', Jun 30) with content that is ~93% identical to
executive-portal.html -- same KPI dashboard, same Decisions Required
Today / Revenue & Performance / AR Aging / Payer Intelligence
sections, just missing a couple of exec-only tiles. The real,
distinct war-room UI (drag-drop document intake, paste-a-document
textarea, 5-engine denial processing pipeline, appeal letter
generator) was lost.

Restored from the last known-good commit before that overwrite
(a3dad71e), then re-applied the fixes made downstream that still
apply to this content:
- relative path fix for tsm-enforcer.js / tsm-kernel.js (b33398aa)
- wrapped several orphaned JS blocks missing their <script> opener
  (same class of bug fixed repo-wide in 7bc12eb0, present
  independently in this older revision)
- removed a premature </body></html> stranding the enforcer/relay/
  kernel boot scripts outside the document (same pattern fixed in
  078b4456)

Verified: all 6 inline script blocks pass node --check; strategist's
TSM_EXEC_FEEDBACK relay is unaffected since executive-portal.html
already writes/reads it independently (the war-room writing it too
was itself a symptom of the clone bug); neither version ever wrote
to TSMMissionStore/tsm_denial_queue so no change there either.

Applied identically to the stale war-rooms/health-war/ duplicate
copy for consistency (still flagged for eventual deletion).
---
 html/healthcare/hc-denial-war-room.html       | 5324 ++++++++--------
 .../health-war/hc-denial-war-room.html        | 5325 ++++++++---------
 2 files changed, 4798 insertions(+), 5851 deletions(-)

